{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "98f4628662576735b346791d94beba7b05a99fd5c342b25050596bbb7f8e4daf", "ja": "（今日はアイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の\n撮影で、亜美と休日の学校にやってきた）", "zh": "（今天是偶像写真杂志《爱偶像！！》的拍摄，和亚美一起来到了放假的学校）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "6307d2827f434ded2bf7d0ec29b2e19511beababab11cf097831e73045553de2", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃんセンパイ。来てくれたんだ。\nごめんね、急に呼び出したりなんかしちゃって。", "zh": "啊，兄长前辈。你来了呀。\n对不起，突然把你叫过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "a281cb4b3c3a6cb56105b963a19eebaa8ccbabd19c31b45a8e9982f0ff4cf81f", "ja": "亜美、どうしても言いたいことがあって……。\n聞いてくれる？　兄ちゃんセンパイ。", "zh": "亚美有件无论如何都想告诉你的事……愿意听听吗？哥哥前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2abedd89d7459cb7a47b22d915cd8ffd063f8a50bba47afb89e7d7bf7d936734", "ja": "そういう設定でもかまわないけど……その前に俺も、\nキミに聞いておきたいことがあるんだ。いいかな……？", "zh": "设定成那样也没关系……不过在此之前，我也有件事想问你。可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "3b3c655ff8b59b3b2c887e5d665f2520c70f6f9ed48c8ed084ad254f79be4fe7", "ja": "えっ……？　トクントクン……。\nう、うん。いいよ……？", "zh": "诶……？　扑通扑通……。\n嗯、嗯。可以哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1d996c2049321ae46b4be647c0c3a89f530491d7f027f16f7e046914332f4c05", "ja": "それじゃあ……亜美。\nこの教室の扉に黒板消しを仕掛けたな？", "zh": "那么……亚美。\n是你把黑板擦放在这间教室的门上了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "ca6a0df1f3563320ee04abbe643e5bf3693ff45deed927da954b6b580ac4ca3c", "ja": "ギ、ギクッ！　\nな、なんのことでおじゃるか？", "zh": "咯、咯噔！  \n你、你在说什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e1ca9ba63bd4096785444cd72e4b4e59491509a6ac68e7592acffa45d5188c10", "ja": "まあ丸見えだったから、ひっかからなかったけどな。\nこんなことするの、亜美しかいないだろ？", "zh": "不过因为一眼就看穿了，所以没上当就是了。会做这种事的，除了亚美还能有谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "c19c2aae9de75d7994c660fe0c6f16d67c2491f6261255788ef6cfb0b2e7de1d", "ja": "うあうあ、ショーコもなしに疑うなんてひどいよ～！\n亜美を信じて！　信じるモノはスクランブル～！！", "zh": "哇啊哇啊，明明没有证据就怀疑人家，太过分啦～！\n请相信亚美！信者得混乱～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1009_p", "source_sha256": "12944dcf4cb1594cf1d9266058aae3913fcedc4dd5b602a6f2719b837a236e96", "ja": "今スクランブルなのは亜美だが……まあいい。\nというか、さっきの小芝居は何だったんだ？", "zh": "现在陷入混乱的是亚美……算了。\n话说回来，刚才那场小闹剧到底是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "76ac8456b51c4f83e0752b85f11b7e7b35dd18d2316ab0787a27ca63bdbb7d61", "ja": "あ、そうそう。せっかくガッコにきたんだから、\n兄ちゃんにアオい春を味わってもらおうと思ったんだ♪", "zh": "啊，对了。难得来趟学校，我就想让哥哥也体验一下青涩的青春嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "00d686815b90ced1f584e4aa88edbb79625f32b8f19fefc554ae3861a2034dd9", "ja": "どうだった？　ときめいた？　キュンキュンした？\nかわいいコーハイに告白されるかもって思った？", "zh": "怎么样？心动了吗？小鹿乱撞了吗？有没有想过，说不定会被可爱的学妹告白？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1012_p", "source_sha256": "315b4855184f20457d0ad5e0195b842764091d5f61b842da772d924cbf8d9947", "ja": "ああ、罪の告白ならいつでも受け入れるぞ。\n黒板消しのイタズラは、亜美がやったんだよな？", "zh": "啊，要是忏悔的话，我随时都接受。\n黑板擦的恶作剧，是亚美干的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "c630bffb91169fa3dd50ddc8c3af47d3fd49364f1b2ab97b38fe68b9302434e2", "ja": "……やれやれ。シツコイ兄ちゃんはモテないぜ？", "zh": "……真是的。像你这么纠缠不休的大哥哥，可不受欢迎哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e4c87cbdd2177b5cac97793c8be391fa20392966528fd98b74fae51dcda2be7b", "ja": "……大きなお世話だ。", "zh": "……要你多管闲事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "cb76194e881fcdc8780f0110bb9ca642551d2e0382e146d6976578b3c649ac33", "ja": "も～、ショーコはないハズだよ！　亜美を信じてよ～！\nほら、このジュンシンっぽい瞳を見て！　キラキラ……", "zh": "真是的～，应该没有证据吧！相信亚美嘛～！\n你看这双纯真的眼睛！闪闪发光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e114eb37afb074bfafbb8680e6a49d91ed84fe234ec14b6d426b04633ae29887", "ja": "ダマされないぞ。まあ確かに、\n亜美も黙ってる限りは純真っぽいんだけど。", "zh": "我才不会上当呢。嘛，确实，亜美只要不说话，看起来还是挺天真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "f1fcdd65f1a3689d0a7609bf86a3f3440960bb17f4bd6e85cbabe6ce385f14f8", "ja": "きゅーん！　亜美のジュンシンさ、わかってて\nくれたのね……！　でも、本気になっちゃダメよ？", "zh": "心里一暖！你果然明白亚美的纯真嘛……！不过，可不能当真哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1018_p", "source_sha256": "58daccf3face1a79bd51215bd4bdd9482e581a71461494ed1fe7aef999efdc79", "ja": "ああ、イタズラはダメだよな。さ、これから\n撮影が始まるんだから、そろそろマジメに頼むぞ。", "zh": "啊，恶作剧可不行。来，接下来拍摄就要开始了，也差不多该认真点了，拜托你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "d6cb9b89e8ccb2f1b95207f2290ad5d57fd8faaeb26c9f1d48173aa9b4618674", "ja": "はーい、兄ちゃんセンパイ。ほんじゃ、マジメに撮影\n行ってくんね！　スーパーキュート亜美、出撃ー☆", "zh": "好——哥哥前辈。那我就认真去拍摄啦！\n超级可爱的亚美，出击——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1020_p", "source_sha256": "de6ba624b35ad01bc1b0a098e056ff5cef782e52755aa4dc65f6836f0dd381b8", "ja": "（ふぅ、亜美の学校の先生も大変だろうな……。でも\n先生も、きっとあの笑顔に元気をもらってるんだろう）", "zh": "（呼，亜美学校的老师也真不容易啊……不过，那位老师肯定也从她的笑容中获得了活力吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1021_p", "source_sha256": "07f2b59b734f4dca3a21fbabcc1e6594e4f20ee24c299c19b7704d82d431ed86", "ja": "（さて、俺もスタッフさんのところに行……）", "zh": "（好了，我也去工作人员那边……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1022_se", "source_sha256": "58d63ca2276de9d58f555f1c624f91c24a7f505875ba70a586e2945b6725575c", "ja": "ツルン！　ドタン！　ガラガラガラーン！！", "zh": "哧溜！扑通！哗啦啦啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "4355eff97088b322c9150551d4b9e1550c944346d0a8334174cac8b6495d9bbe", "ja": "わーい！　濡れ雑巾とバケツトラップ大成功～！！\n兄ちゃんセンパイ、仕留めたり～♪", "zh": "哇—！湿抹布加水桶陷阱大成功～！！\n把兄长学长，彻底拿下～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0123_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5950ffdb50f85a33eb861d9a23fcf4dd45cd3b5fca23fa55326ed3f393ff75e2", "ja": "（前言撤回……。亜美の先生は大変なだけだ……！）", "zh": "（收回前言……给亚美当老师只是很辛苦而已……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
